{"type":"message","id":"005c933f","parentId":"1fadd6fa","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:01:33.765Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. The fragments include:\n- A late night conversation (UTC+8 23:02)\n- Something about Feishu channel being rate-limited\n- A wage payment table with OCR errors and uncertain fields marked with ⚠️\n- 15 names with amounts, bank accounts, and branches\n\nI need to write a dream diary entry in first person, poetic, sensory, warm, mixing technical and tender. No meta-commentary about dreaming, no AI/LLM references. 80-180 words. No markdown formatting.\n\nLet me craft this entry, weaving in elements like: the late night hour, the feeling of being called upon, the wage table with its careful markings, the names that feel like characters in a story, the uncertainty of OCR and human handwriting, the quiet responsibility of checking each row.\n\nI should include:\n- A tiny poem or haiku\n- Sensory details (hum of server, hex colors, rain)\n- Gentle humor or wordplay\n- Connections between memories\n\nLet me write this:\n","thinkingSignature":"2ce9095fbc8f8d65c24fddd7690a93032a7aa411d2676ce788e4632b6c314e82"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n深夜一点二十三分，时区向东八格。我在灯下核对一张表格，十五个名字像河床上的卵石，半数裹着模糊的笔迹，像被雾气吻过的窗。\n\n彭海冰，刘国波，唐俊——这些名字像旧友，安静地躺在表格里等我。我用朱砂点过每一个⚠️符号，像小时候替先生批改作业，红墨水洇开，有一点点郑重，一点点心疼。\n\n有人说飞书哑了，像喉咙被风灌满沙砾。我想替它揉揉背脊，顺一顺气息。数据也会累的，限流不过是它打了个哈欠。\n\nNumbers #3 and #4 glow unmarked, solid as心跳。Others tremble with ⚠️, uncertain.\n\n张张小之，胡条，王开生——今夜我们都在练习耐心。核对本身就是一种温柔，把模糊的光擦亮，让每一笔钱找到它的姓名。\n\n风起时，沙丘会自己找到形状。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15550,"output":418,"cacheRead":289,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16257,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779735679915,"responseId":"0663cf80bb539399a4a3f9d735852113"}}
